        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha Waisraeli wote walikusanyika pamoja kwa Daudi huko Hebroni, wakamwambia: “Tazama, sisi ni mwili na damu yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hapo awali, Shauli alipokuwa mfalme wewe ndiwe uliyewaongoza Waisraeli vitani, na Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako alikuambia, ‘Utakuwa mchungaji wa watu wangu Israeli, na utakuwa mkuu wa watu wangu Israeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, wazee wote wa Israeli wakamwendea mfalme huko Hebroni; naye Daudi akafanya agano nao mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, halafu wakampaka Daudi mafuta awe mfalme wa Waisraeli kulingana na neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu lililotolewa kwa njia ya Samueli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadaye Daudi na Waisraeli wote walikwenda Yerusalemu uliojulikana kama Yebusi, na ambao wenyeji wake walikuwa Wayebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakazi wa Yebusi walimwambia Daudi, “Hutaingia katika mji huu.” Hata hivyo, Daudi aliiteka ngome ya Siyoni, yaani mji wa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Daudi akasema, “Mtu atakayetangulia kuwapiga Wayebusi, atakuwa mkuu na kamanda jeshini.” Basi Yoabu, mwana wa Seruya, akawa wa kwanza kuwashambulia, hivyo akawa mkuu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi alikaa katika ngome hiyo, na kwa hiyo, mji huo ukaitwa “Mji wa Daudi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aliujenga mji huo, akianzia Milo, na kuuzunguka wote, na Yoabu akautengeneza mji huo upya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi akazidi kuwa mkuu kwa sababu Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi alikuwa pamoja naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hii ndiyo orodha ya wakuu wa mashujaa wa Daudi, ambao pamoja na watu wengine wote wa Israeli, walimuunga mkono kwa pamoja ili awe mfalme, sawa na neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu alilotoa juu ya Waisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuatayo ni orodha ya mashujaa hao wa Daudi: Yashobeamu, Mhakmoni, aliyekuwa kiongozi wa “Wale thelathini.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "“Wale thelathini”",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "au wale watatu; tafsiri moja ya zamani (taz 2Sam 23:8).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yeye alipigana kwa mkuki wake akaua watu 300 kwa mara moja vitani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu aliyefuata miongoni mwa wale mashujaa watatu alikuwa Eleazari mwana wa Dodo, Mwahohi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku moja Eleazari alikuwa pamoja na Daudi huko Pas-damimu, wakati Wafilisti walipokusanyika kupigana vita. Huko kulikuwa na shamba lenye shayiri tele, nao Waisraeli walikuwa wamewakimbia Wafilisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Daudi na Eliazari walisimama imara katikati ya shamba hilo ili kulitetea, wakawaua Wafilisti; Mwenyezi-Mungu akawaokoa kwa kuwapa ushindi mkubwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha mashujaa watatu kati ya wakuu thelathini waliteremka hadi kwenye mwamba, wakamwendea Daudi kwenye pango huko Adulamu. Wakati huo jeshi la Wafilisti lilikuwa limepiga kambi katika bonde la Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Daudi wakati huo alikuwa katika ngome, nalo jeshi la Wafilisti lilikuwa mjini Bethlehemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akasema kwa hamu kubwa, “Laiti kama mtu angeweza kunipa maji ya kunywa kutoka katika kisima cha Bethlehemu kilicho karibu na lango la mji!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wale mashujaa wake watatu walitoka, wakapenya katikati ya kambi ya jeshi la Wafilisti, wakaenda na kuchota maji katika kisima cha Bethlehemu, karibu na lango la mji, wakamletea Daudi. Lakini Daudi akakataa kuyanywa, na badala yake akayamwaga chini kama tambiko kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akisema, “Tendo kama hili lipitishie mbali nami; siwezi kulifanya mbele ya Mungu wangu. Je, waweza kunywa damu ya maisha ya watu hawa? Maana kwa kuyahatarisha maisha yao walileta maji haya.” Kwa hiyo Daudi hakuyanywa maji hayo. Hayo ndio mambo waliyotenda wale mashujaa watatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai, nduguye Yoabu, alikuwa mkuu wa mashujaa thelathini. Yeye alipigana kwa mkuki wake dhidi ya watu 300, akawaua, akajipatia jina miongoni mwa wale mashujaa watatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, akawa mashuhuri zaidi miongoni mwa mashujaa thelathini, hata akawa kamanda wao, lakini hakuwa shujaa kama wale mashujaa watatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Benaya, mwana wa Yehoyada, kutoka Kabzeeli, alikuwa askari shujaa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "askari shujaa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiebrania: Mwana wa askari shujaa.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ambaye alifanya mambo mengi ya ajabu. Aliwaua mashujaa wawili",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mashujaa wawili:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kiebrania si dhahiri.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kutoka Moabu, na siku moja wakati wa barafu, alishuka na kuua simba shimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vilevile, alimuua Mmisri mmoja, mtu mrefu sana, urefu wake kama mita mbili, naye mkononi mwake alikuwa amebeba mkuki mkubwa sana, kama mti wa mfumaji. Lakini Benaya alimwendea akiwa na fimbo tu, akamnyanganya mkuki huo, na kumuua Mmisri huyo kwa mkuki wake mwenyewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Benaya, mwana wa Yehoyada alifanya mambo haya, akajipatia jina miongoni mwa wale mashujaa watatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, akawa mashuhuri kati ya wale mashujaa thelathini, ingawa hakuwa shujaa kama wale mashujaa watatu. Na Daudi akampa cheo cha mkuu wa walinzi wake binafsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanajeshi mashujaa wa Daudi walikuwa: Asaheli nduguye Yoabu, Elhanani mwana wa Dodo wa Bethlehemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shamothi Mharodi, Helesi Mpeloni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ira, mwana wa Ikeshi Mtekoa, Abiezeri Mwanathothi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibekai Mhushathi; Ilai Mwahohi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maharai Mnetofathi; Heledi, mwana wa Baana Mnetofathi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itai, mwana wa Ribai, kutoka Gibea, wa kabila la Benyamini; Benaya Mpirathoni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hurai kutoka vijito vya Gaashi, Abieli Mwaibathi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azmawethi Mbaharumu; Eliaba Mshaalboni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wana wa Yasheni Mgiloni; Yonathani, mwana wa Shagee Mharari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahiamu, mwana wa Sakari Mharari; Elifali, mwana wa Uri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heferi Mmekerathi; Ahiya Mpeloni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hezro Mkarmeli; Naarai, mwana wa Ezbai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoeli, nduguye Nathani; Mibhari, mwana wa Hagri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zeleki Mwamoni; Naharai Mbeerothi, aliyekuwa mbeba silaha wa Yoabu, mwana wa Seruya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ira na Garebu, waliokuwa Waithri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uria, Mhiti; Zabadi, mwana wa Ahlai; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adina, mwana wa Shiza Mreubeni, mkuu wa Wareubeni, akiwa pamoja na watu thelathini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanani, mwana wa Maaka, Yoshafati Mmithni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uzia Mwashterathi, Shama na Yeieli, wana wa Hothamu Mwaroeri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yediaeli na Yoha nduguye, wana wa Shimri Mtizi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elieli Mmahawi, Yeribai na Yoshavia wana wa Elnaamu; Ithma Mmoabu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 11:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elieli, Obedi, na Yaasieli Mmesobai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.11.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.11.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
